; error: 6:20: the type of a lambda names only the region it keeps what it uses in, '[@r]'; the places it keeps are its own, so its type doesn't name 'n'
; The type of a lambda names only its region.
task main()
    region r
    hold n = 0
    bind f: [hold& n, @r]() -> nothing = [@r]() -> nothing show(1) fi
fi
